细节尽显。</div><div class="text-sm">拍照更清晰，记录每一缕光影变幻。以 5000 万像素，定格当下这一刻的美好。</div></div><div class="arrow-list"><button class="arrow-l" data-object-click="50mp_left"><svg class="icon-arrow" width="9" height="14" viewBox="0 0 9 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path opacity="0.75" d="M2.125 1.375L7.75 7L2.125 12.625" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><button class="arrow-r" data-object-click="50mp_right"><svg class="icon-arrow" width="9" height="14" viewBox="0 0 9 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path opacity="0.75" d="M2.125 1.375L7.75 7L2.125 12.625" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg class="circle" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 42 42" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="42" height="42" stroke-dashoffset="126"><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#E2001A" stroke-width="2" stroke-dashoffset="inherit" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="126 126"></circle></svg></button></div></div><div class="splide wrapper-imgs"><div class="splide__track"><ul class="splide__list"><li class="splide__slide"><div class="wrapper-img active"><img alt="photo" data-src="https://res.insta360.com/static/4c50a7b848181bedc607d4d8888b40c2/50MP_PC_1.jpg"/><div class="mask"></div></div></li><li class="splide__slide"><div class="wrapper-img"><img alt="photo" data-src="https://res.insta360.com/static/1fcf5291dcd2d9cfc86b232dec8d768e/50MP_PC_2.jpg"/><div class="mask"></div></div></li><li class="splide__slide"><div class="wrapper-img"><img alt="photo" data-src="https://res.insta360.com/static/717243f4e5c47a28243c09dac27484d4/50MP_PC_3.jpg"/><div class="mask"></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="sec-color" data-object="[10] COLOR YOUR WORLD"><div class="wrapper-ct"><div class="text-group"><div class="text font-gilroy">所见即所拍，<span>色彩</span>更出彩。</div></div><div clas