Box="0 0 8 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.21875 1.75L6.46875 7L1.21875 12.25" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="wrapper-tab-list"><div class="tab-list"><div class="tab-list-bg"></div><div class="tab-items"><div class="tab font-gilroy active" data-object-click="creativity_timeshift">移动延时</div><div class="tab font-gilroy" data-object-click="creativity_starlapse">星空延时</div><div class="tab font-gilroy" data-object-click="creativity_timelapse">延时摄影</div><div class="tab font-gilroy" data-object-click="creativity_aiselfiestick">自拍杆消除 </div><div class="tab font-gilroy" data-object-click="creativity_aiwarp">AI 魔术师</div></div></div></div><div class="caption"><div class="text-sm"><span class="active">轻松解锁时空加速的炫酷效果。步履之间，城市穿梭等创意大片尽在掌握。</span><span>让暗光摄影变得轻松，完美捕捉满天星辰绚烂。 </span><span>捕捉时光流转，记录云卷云舒，将美景揉于一瞬。</span><span>后期通过 Insta360 App 可消除画面中的自拍杆，仿佛有专业摄影师随行跟拍。无需上传云端，本地即可处理和出片。</span><span>AI 可以为高光时刻增添炫酷的动感特效，能应用于整个画面或画面中的特定部分。犹如变魔术一般，带来令人惊叹的视觉震撼力。<div class="tip">*为限免功能，使用达一定次数后将收费。 </div></span></div></div></div></section><div id="page_acc"></div><section class="sec-acc" data-object="[30] ACCESSORIES"><div class="wrapper-ct"><div class="sec-header font-gilroy">精选配件，全面装配。</div><div class="view-more"><a data-buynow-click="accessory_View more accessories" href="https://store.insta360.com/accessory?compatibility=46&amp;i_source=website&amp;i_medium=product_page_button&amp;i_campaign=ace-pro-2" target="_blank">查看全部配件</a><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.58857 2.55732C4.30381 2.84207 4.30381 3.30376 4.58857 3.58851L7.86464 6.86458L4.58857 10.1407C4.30381 10.4254 4.30381 10.8871 4.58857 11.1718C4.87332 11.4566 5.33501 11.4566 5.61976 11.1718L9.41143 7.38018C9.69619 7.09543 9.69619 6.63374 9.41143 6.34898L5.61977 2.55732C5.33501 2.27256 4.87332 2.27256 4.5