=\"https://www.insta360.com/support/supportcourse?post_id=20166\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e-9.Special rules for U.S. residents\", for more information about your rights and our privacy practices.","common.do_not_sell.text2":"Selling, Sharing, Targeted Advertising","common.do_not_sell.text3":"We may use personal information to support “targeted advertising,” “selling,” or “sharing,” as defined by applicable privacy laws, which may result in third parties receiving your personal information. You can move the toggle above to the left to opt out of these activities on the websites related to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.insta360.com/\"\u003ewww.insta360.com\u003c/a\u003e consistent with applicable law. Please note that, because these activities are based on online cookies, your opt-out choice is specific to this property. If you access other websites of Insta360, you will need to make your election for each. Also, if you clear your cookies on this browser or use another browser or device, you may need to opt out again on this property.You may also choose to enable online, where available, a universal tool that automatically communicates your opt-out preferences, such as the Global Privacy Control (“GPC”). We will process the GPC signal as a request to opt out.​\n\nPlease be aware that even if you opt out, you may still see ads based on personal information processed before you opt out.","common.do_not_sell.btn":"Confirm","common.header.shop_by_interest.travel":"Travel","common.floating_service.online_chat":"在线支持","common.floating_service.office_hours":"周一至周日：9:00-21:00（北京时间）","common.floating_service.start_chat":"开始咨询","common.floating_service.purchase_support":"Purchase Support","common.floating_service.purchase_support_working_hours":"Working hours: Mon-Sun 9:00-22:00 (GMT+8)","common.floating_service.technical_support":"Technical Support","common.floating_service.technical_support_working_hours":"Working hours: Mon-Fri 8:00-24:00 (GMT+8)","com