ce Pro 2 – AI 双芯 8K 运动相机，与徕卡联合研发","product_ace_pro2.sensor.title_m":"    性能再升级，\n    大作有底气。","product_ace_pro2.chip.title_m":"    双芯出动，\n    画质更出众。","product_ace_pro2.audio.title2_m":"无惧嘈杂，\n“声”临其境。","product_ace_pro2.acc.title_m":"精选配件，\n全面装配。","product_ace_pro2.bento.img":"https://res.insta360.com/static/9faf8fd583c1c8b706304d5b73eccde0/Bento_PC_SC.jpg","product_ace_pro2.bento.img_m":"https://res.insta360.com/static/a9e96c1fb5ec259d707d658b29acae39/Bento_MO_SC_small_2x.jpg","product_ace_pro2.stab.no_stabilization":"防抖关闭","product_ace_pro2.stab.flowstate_stabilization":"FlowState 防抖科技","product_ace_pro2.purevideo.other_flagship_cameras":"其他品牌旗舰相机","product_ace_pro2.purevideo.purevideo":"夜景录像","product_ace_pro2.color.ace_pro2":"影石Insta360 Ace Pro 2","product_ace_pro2.asset.video_launch":"https://media.insta360.com/static/e0ae1c62b3b6d81ae3379b450bfc6450/Ace Pro 2_CN_16-9_4K.mp4","product_ace_pro2.asset.youtube_launch":"fA5Q1kZ6bNw","product_ace_pro2.sub_header.logo":"影石Insta360 Ace Pro 2","product_ace_pro2.asset.img_chip":"https://res.insta360.com/static/4fabdd0e8fcf8f047a796d7eea131d05/AIChipSC.jpg","product_ace_pro2.asset.img_100_up":"https://res.insta360.com/static/84d656bba78942f992bd9124d8dcd336/touchscreen-100.png","product_ace_pro2.asset.img_70_up":"https://res.insta360.com/static/b01ca14f15fda22f62ccaf0a18765d4d/70.png","product_ace_pro2.asset.img_timecode":"https://res.insta360.com/static/c2b71b094839617a90b01de5789c3f87/SC_PC.jpg","product_ace_pro2.asset.img_timecode_m":"https://res.insta360.com/static/6863fa11522711e9aad51c4918d1b598/SC_MO.jpg","product_ace_pro2.bento.why_choose_m":"集结强大，\n运动影像新标杆","product_ace_pro2.ride_smarter.pre_recording_tip":"*在录像、夜景录像、自由比例录像模式下拍摄 1440p 及以下档位视频时，最高支持 120 秒预录制时长。","product_ace_pro2.asset.logo_slogan_with_shadow":"https://res.insta360.com/static/65ac67484cdaf319ac756a663c2529b3/SC-v2.svg","product_ace_pro2.purevideo.ace_pro":"影石Insta360 Ace Pro","product_ace_pro2.purevideo.cam_a":"其他品牌旗舰相机 A","product_ace_pro2.purevid